{"id": "66123", "title": "帝都情圣", "author": "文斐", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 15, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/66/66123.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／校园故事／一般言情／轻松\r\n\r\n关键字：主角 　配角 　其他 \r\n\r\n文案：\r\n\r\n17岁的职高生聂拓因一次酒后“失误”夺走了英语老师欣欣的初次，他后悔莫及上杆子对姑娘负责，人家却不搭理自己。厚著脸皮使尽阴谋诡计的聂拓终于抱得美人归和欣欣如胶似漆，谁知半路竟然杀出个漂亮大胆的林倩，几乎把二人的甜蜜世界搅黄，面对红玫瑰白玫瑰，他将作何选择？一个80后用青春和眼泪撰写的真实得可以触摸得到的故事就这样开场了。", "base": "files/article/html/66/66123", "chapters": [{"title": "1-3", "file": "9919778.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4-6", "file": "9919779.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7-9", "file": "9919780.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10-15", "file": "9919781.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-22", "file": "9919782.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23", "file": "9919783.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24", "file": "9919784.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25", "file": "9919785.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26", "file": "9919786.html", "available": false}, {"title": "27", "file": "9919787.html", "available": false}, {"title": "28", "file": "9919788.html", "available": false}, {"title": "29", "file": "9919789.html", "available": false}, {"title": "30", "file": "9919790.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31", "file": "9919791.html", "available": false}, {"title": "32", "file": "9919792.html", "available": false}]}